      "snippet": "\n386 U.S. 171 (1967)\nVACA ET AL.\nv.\nSIPES, ADMINISTRATOR.\nNo. 114.\nSupreme Court of United States.\nArgued November 17, 1966.\nDecided February 27, 1967.\nCERTIORARI TO THE SUPREME COURT OF MISSOURI.\n*172 David E. Feller argued the cause for petitioners. With him on the brief were Henry A. Panethiere, Russe",
