      "snippet": "\n69 U.S. 510 (1864)\n2 Wall. 510\nMILWAUKIE AND MINNESOTA RAILROAD COMPANY AND FLEMING, APPELLANTS,\nv.\nSOUTTER, SURVIVOR.\nSupreme Court of United States.\n\n*516 Mr. Carpenter, for the appellants.\nMessrs. Cary and Carlisle, contra.\n*519 Mr. Justice MILLER delivered the opinion ",
