      "snippet": "\n507 U.S. 725 (1993)\nUNITED STATES\nv.\nOLANO et al.\nNo. 91-1306.\nUnited States Supreme Court.\nArgued December 9, 1992.\nDecided April 26, 1993.\nCERTIORARI TO THE UNITED STATES COURT OF APPEALS FOR THE NINTH CIRCUIT\n*726 O'Connor, J., delivered the opinion of the Court, in which Rehnquist, C. J., and Scalia, Kennedy,",
