      },
      "ordering_key": 2,
      "per_curiam": false,
      "sha1": "",
      "snippet": "\nJustice Kennedy,\nconcurring.\nI join the Court\u2019s opinion and add this brief statement to express my own understanding of the Court\u2019s holding.\nWhen a court notices an error on its own initiatiye under Federal Rule of Criminal Procedure 52(b), see Silber v. United States, 370 U. S. 717, 718 (1962) (per curiam), it may be awkward to say that the case is decided by ",
      "type": "concurrence-opinion"
    },
