        "date_created": "2023-08-02T23:36:21.563716Z"
      },
      "ordering_key": 3,
      "per_curiam": false,
      "sha1": "",
      "snippet": "\nJustice Stevens,\nwith whom Justice White and Justice Blackmun join, dissenting.\nUnder Federal Rule of Criminal Procedure 24(c), the trial judge in this case had a clear and unqualified duty to dismiss the alternate jurors at the end of the trial. Indeed, she could no more admit the alternate jurors into the jury room than she could afford any stranger access to that room while the defendants\u2019 guilt or innocence ",
