      "ordering_key": 3,
      "per_curiam": false,
      "sha1": "",
      "snippet": "\nMr. Justice Black,\ndissenting.\nThe Court today opens slightly the courthouse door to an employee\u2019s incidental claim against his union for breach of its duty of fair representation, only to shut it in his face when he seeks direct judicial relief for his underlying and more valuable breach-of-contract claim against his employer. This result follows from the Court\u2019s announcement in this case, involving an employee",
